    * Disable defsWithUnderscore linter in runPhyslibLinters
    
    This mathlib env-linter flags any def/instance/structure-projection whose
    name contains an underscore. In Physlib it produces many false positives:
    the deliberate `_physlib` instance suffix (mirroring mathlib's exempted
    `_mathlib`), and `informal_lemma`s which elaborate to `def`s but follow
    the snake_case lemma naming convention. Filter it out of the linter run.
    
