    auto-task(DampedHarmonicOscillator): add API-map.yaml tracking the damped harmonic oscillator API (#1265)
    
    * auto-task(DampedHarmonicOscillator): add API-map.yaml tracking the damped harmonic oscillator API
    
    Co-authored-by: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
    
    * fix(scripts): only treat .lean files as modules in check_file_imports
    
    `addModulesIn` / `expectedPhyslibImports` took the file stem of every entry
    under `Physlib/`, so a non-Lean file such as the new `API-map.yaml` placed at
    the top of an API directory was treated as a module and reported as a missing
    import (e.g. `import Physlib.ClassicalMechanics.DampedHarmonicOscillator.«API-map»`).
    
    Filter to files with the `.lean` extension, matching what
    `scripts/PhyslibAlpha/alphaFileImports.py` already does with `rglob("*.lean")`.
    This lets `API-map.yaml` tracker files live at the top of an API directory
    without tripping the Physlib import linter.
    
    Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>
    
