commit 496132074aed1c834cad87fd02f2bf6fce0e5a2a
Author: Robby Sneiderman <robbysneiderman@gmail.com>
Date:   Wed Jul 1 00:54:13 2026 -0500

    feat(LorentzGroup): realize as closed subgroup of GL (#1337)
    
    Promote toGL to a closed embedding into GL (Fin 1 ⊕ Fin d) ℝ (toGL_isClosedEmbedding)
    and package the Lorentz group as a (closed) subgroup of the general linear group
    (toGLSubgroup, toClosedSubgroup), following the plan from issue #833.
    
    The Lie group instance and Lorentz algebra remain open: they require the closed
    subgroup theorem (Cartan), which is not yet available in Mathlib.

